    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu botho jal moro ma two",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo ma Sabato moro, Yesu okidho cemo i ot pa acel kwoŋ Jofarisayo madongo; aka ji jorieko waŋ gin kwoŋe tektek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo jal moro ma tiende gi cinge oyido obumbere obino bonge, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to Yesu luwo malo munyo penjo Jondiko kodi Jofarisayo ni, “Cik mawan yeyo botho dhano i ndelo ma Sabato, kosa be?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To joliŋaliŋa. Yesu okwanyo ŋato, obotho go to sewila go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.12.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 12:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo to Yesu penjo jo ni, “Ŋa kwoŋ win ma ka punda pere kosa thwon pere opodho i dago maluth i ndelo ma Sabato, di kinyal ywayo to wodho woko mayot?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jok'onyalo dwoko go wac no.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bwonirok kodi jolo wendo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Yesu oneno paka wendo joyero kabedo ma malo, oluwo rijo iy'ageca ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.25.6+PRO.25.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Agec 25:6-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “K'olwoŋin i kalima ma nywomirok, ikir'iyer kabedo ma malo, ipoyo ŋatiman ma loyin gi dwoŋ bende olwoŋi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ameno ŋat'olwoŋo win nyalo bino to waco rin ni, ‘Weyi kabedo no ri ŋati me.’ Gikenyo, ibino ay giwickwot madwoŋ, t'ikowere i kabedo ma piny loyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kucel, k'ibedo wendo, comi yu kabedo ma piny t'ibedo kenyo, aka ka ŋat'olwoŋo win obino, ama wowaci rin ni, ‘Jawodhan, core ye yumalo kaca.’ Ameno dhano je ma nikodin i dhower kenyo bino miyin dwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.23.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 23:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.18.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 18:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato ŋata won miyere dwoŋ ibino dwoko piny, aka ŋata won bwonere am'ibino miyo dwoŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Yesu owaco ri jadwoŋ m'olwoŋo go ni, “K'iyiko kalima ri ji, ikir'ilwoŋ merin perin kosa wutmin in kosa wade perin kosa joger perin ma joŋaŋ kende, rupiri jono jonyalo culin kemba munyo bende jolwoŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka iyiko kalima madwoŋ, lwoŋ jocandi, jom'ogiyagiya, jom'oŋol kodi joma waŋ gin otho bende, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka inolimi silwany, rupiri jono mere jok'onyal culin kemba moro, to Were won ama bino culin i ndelo ma jomaleŋ jobino cerino iye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ageca kwoŋ kalima madwoŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo acel kwoŋ jom'obedo dhower gi Yesu owinjo gime, owaco ri Yesu ni, “Jasilwany a ŋat'ocam mugat i Ker pa Were.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Yesu owaco rigo ni, “Dhano moro cango otimo kalima madwoŋ, to lwoŋo ji mathoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka i hongo ma cemo, go odhiro jotic pere waco ri joma go olwoŋo ni, ‘Biye win, kole gimoro je otieko yikere.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To joje jocako kwayo cwaki ayino. Ŋati marapena owaco ni, ‘Atieko nyewo lowo, aka aripo kidho neno; akwayin icwaki ran.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋati man owaco ni, ‘Atieko nyewo megikwe abic, aka onyo akidho temo jo; akwayin icwaki ran.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋati man owaco ni, ‘Kole nyaka anywomo manyen, riameno akinyali bino.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo jatic no ogik to dwoko wac ri rwoth pere. Won peco owaco ri jatic pere no gi nge ni, ‘Kidhi i royo madwoŋ kodi i royo je m'okare i tindi, idwoki kodi jocandi gi jom'omienere gi joma waŋ gin otho kodi jom'oŋol.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jatic no owaco ni, ‘Jadwoŋ gim'iwaco no je otieko timere, to fodi kabedo nitie m'odoŋ.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka won peco odoko owaco ri jatic no ni, ‘Kidhi i royo man woko ma tindi kodi i thengi royo moro je, ilwoŋ ji jowobin i ot paran, ot wopoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awaco riwin ni ongoye moro kwoŋ jom'onwaŋo otel lwoŋo jo m'obil cemo paran.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gima yenyere ibedo jafonjirok",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo lwak ji m'oasere oyido jokwaŋo Yesu; aka Yesu owire oŋiyo yucen to waco rijo ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 10:37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Moro je ma bino bongan kinyal bedo jafonjirok paran ma k'okutho okwero bamere gi yokimere, kodi cege, kodi nyithindho pere gi wutmin gi nyimin, kiri gi kwo pere won. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 10:38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.16.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.8.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 8:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.9.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 9:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋata won kitiŋi musalaba pere aka luwan, kinyal bedo jafonjirok paran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere ŋa kwoŋ win ma ka mito gero ot acurcur, kikuthi bedi piny to kwano welo pesa ma mitere, to neno ka nyalo cowo tic no kosa be? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kak'ameno, ka go otieko gero tiendi ot, to cowo mere dhiero go, ji je ma joneno geto no jobino cako nyero go, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka jowaco ni, ‘Neni win, ŋatin orikin cako geto gima go k'onyalo cowo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosa, kere mene ma ka kidho romo gi kere man i lweny, kikuthi bedi piny to rango rieko paka go nyalo kwanyo jolweny gana apar kidho romo gi ŋati ca ma nitie gi jolweny gana piero ario? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka k'oneno ni kinyal, ka kere man ca fodi nibor ye, to dhiro rigo jamikwenda wokway winjirok ma siem i dier jo ayin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo, i dier win ŋata kimaran loyo gimoro je ma go nitie gine, meno kinyal bedo jafonjirok paran.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cumbi ma bukony",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Cumbi ber, to ka cwe mere orumo woko, bero no odoko ogik nedi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cumbi no ngoye kony ri lowo kosa ri kidhur yuk ma topo lowo; ikonjo woko ayin. Ŋata nitie gi ithe ma winjo wowinji.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.14.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
